{
  "$comment": [
    "skill-orchestrator map for the Oikonotes / Copepod / copepod-rust-sdk / leptos-daisyui flow.",
    "Applies to any pi session started in this repo, including dispatches into sibling worktrees",
    "(the session's repo decides the map). Owner policy 2026-11-16: every model is hosted on",
    "Mistral (La Plateforme); Anthropic (Opus) only for the per-spec go/no-go gate and as the",
    "escalation after Mistral fails twice, under the anthropic budget in the user map.",
    "Session/orchestrator: mistral-large-4 @ high (settings.json default). TDD: oiko-test-author",
    "(glm-5-3) writes failing tests, oiko-implementer (large-4) makes them pass, oiko-reviewer",
    "(glm-5-3, a different model from the implementer) and oiko-security-reviewer (large-4) review",
    "every slice, oiko-acceptance (large-4) accepts the spec, oiko-gate (Opus) decides go/no-go.",
    "glm-5-3 is text-only: screenshots are read by large-4 (orchestrator, acceptance, security)."
  ],
